        "created_at": "2017-04-06T00:09:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I got a lot of mileage out of using it to put Close Quarters Combat into play and benefit from the +1 for the rest of the heroes' turns.</p><p>Granted, that sometimes meant the trains were hitting us for 6 a pop, but hey, they hit Voss, too.</p>",
