        "created_at": "2017-04-06T14:45:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In my experience, Rook City Wraith excels most in Rook City, where you'll want to avoid&nbsp;<em>most</em>&nbsp;of the cards, and popping them straight into the trash avoids the harsher destroy conditions, like those cards that play from the villain deck when they're destroyed.</p>",
