      {
        "id": 194615,
        "name": "MindWanderer",
        "username": "MindWanderer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-04-07T00:57:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint. &nbsp;Looked touch-and-go for a little while, and I made some mistakes with AZ (I've never used Termi-Nation AZ before) that resulted in his premature death. &nbsp;However, his incap powers are so great, especially with this team, that the rest was a cakewalk. &nbsp;Reducing all but cold damage when you're using Panzer-Buster anyway is just gold, and getting Tempest to play extra cards with Gene-Bound Shackes out speeds up the win by a fair amount. &nbsp;Got into a nice offensive loop Reclaiming Tachyon's big damage cards, and a nice defensive loop with Bunker with Turret Mode, Maintainance, and Plating, but neither was remotely necessary by then.</p>",
